nt\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240604140454&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Raspberry_Sirup_1fe673.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a flask with raspberry sirup.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Raspberry Sirup</strong> is one of 3 different sirups used in part of the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Sweet Dreams Quest</a> which are later applied to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key\">Gingerbread Key</a>. \n</p><p>To make this sirup you must combine <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\">Sugar (Quest)</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Sugar (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Quest_9c6d9d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\">Raspberry</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\"><img alt=\"Raspberry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Raspberry_7b03f3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p>If you wish to make additional sirups for decoration or to create multiple <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\">Gingerbread Keys</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\"><img alt=\"Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon, Raspberry and Lemon)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_Moon_Melon_Raspberry_and_Lemon_8e2aaf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> you <b>must remain at this stage of the quest</b> until you have gathered as many as you need. Once you progress past this part of the quest, you will no longer be able to collect the 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\">Sugar Cubes</a> each hour.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key\">Gingerbread Key</a></li><li>Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon and Raspberry)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\">Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon, Raspberry and Lemon)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\">Raspberry</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\">Sugar (Quest)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["threatened-dreams-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"threatened-dreams-quest","quest":"Threatened Dreams Quest","step":"7-9","n":74,"title":"Fazer os xaropes","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}